    "Use these PNGs as the implementation source for the new MatchOverlay canvas pass.",
    "Do not use the flattened target or atlas directly in Unity UI.",
    "Frames, fills, icons, and selected states remain separate Image objects.",
    "Button and squad tab objects keep animator-driven selected/normal states.",
    "TMP text remains live text; no label text is baked into these assets.",
    "All SCN-08 target-quality replacement slices in this package are sourced from imagegen atlases; deterministic tools are limited to alpha extraction, cropping, metadata, and validation.",
    "For M01, command order is SELECT, MOVE, ATTACK, STOP, HOLD; SPECIAL is not part of the M01 command family.",
    "The 2026-05-16 alpha-quality fix removes green chroma-key edge spill from SCN-08 layer slices while preserving the accepted M01 command order.",
